SSHYard bundles 73 selected icons as 74 unchanged original SVG files,
including the upstream toml_light.svg variant; SHA256SUMS records each
vendored asset. Other themes share the same original SVG where upstream
has no light variant. The selection and basename associations are local
SSHYard code, not the complete upstream VS Code association manifest.
No JavaScript, npm dependency, icon font, or network download is used at runtime.

The upstream package README credits these icon sources:
- Material Design Icons, Pictogrammers: https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/
- Material Symbols, Google: https://fonts.google.com/icons
Upstream does not identify a source-library version or per-icon derivation
for the selected artwork; no such attribution mapping is inferred here.
